Debt Destroyer V2 — iPhone-first PWA prototype.

Upload the contents of this folder to a static HTTPS host such as GitHub Pages.
Then open the HTTPS URL in Safari on iPhone and use Share > Add to Home Screen.
The app stores user data locally in the browser/device.

For App Store release, this is still a prototype and needs production engineering,
privacy/legal work, accessibility testing, analytics/consent decisions, subscription
implementation if used, App Store assets, and a native/distribution build.
